# Agent config is local by default (the 10x-cli regenerates most of it), with
# two exceptions: the quality hooks are project infrastructure and belong in
# review alongside the checks they run (scripts/quality/, .githooks/).
/.claude/*
!/.claude/settings.json
!/.claude/hooks/
/.agents
skills-lock.json
CLAUDE.md
# packages/ai-toolkit ships this as a package asset install.js reads — must stay tracked
!/packages/ai-toolkit/rules/CLAUDE.md
